# This repo only syncs the "Public stuff" folder.
# Everything else in this working directory is ignored on purpose.
*
!.gitignore
!README.md
!Public stuff/
!Public stuff/**

# OS / editor junk files, ignored even inside "Public stuff"
**/.DS_Store
**/.DS_Store?
**/._*
**/.Spotlight-V100
**/.Trashes
**/ehthumbs.db
**/Thumbs.db
**/desktop.ini

# Python bytecode caches, ignored even inside "Public stuff"
**/__pycache__/
**/*.pyc
**/*.pyo

# Virtual environments -- rebuild with the pip installs in TRIKE.md
**/.venv/
**/venv/

# MediaPipe hand model (7.8 MB binary) -- download it with the curl command
# in "Public stuff/useful libraries/TRIKE.md"
**/hand_landmarker.task
# Throwaway venv created by virtualTesting/setup_test_env.py, ignored even
# inside "Public stuff"
Public stuff/virtualTesting/test/

# Sync only the MQTT controller within Codrin's otherwise local projects.
!Codrin's Projects/
Codrin's Projects/*
!Codrin's Projects/MQTT Robot Control/
Codrin's Projects/MQTT Robot Control/*
!Codrin's Projects/MQTT Robot Control/robot_control.py
!Codrin's Projects/MQTT Robot Control/requirements.txt
!Codrin's Projects/MQTT Robot Control/README.md
!Codrin's Projects/MQTT Robot Control/Start Robot Control.bat
